mething important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn6le18ob05re7pdf01.pdf"}], "type": "question"}]}], "type": "DWS", "id": 11, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nTalk about memorable gifts you gave or received.\n"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le18ob05re2img07.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le18ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le18ob05re2img07.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le18ob05re2img07.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: In my family it's traditional to unwrap one gift at a time. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: At my house we folded the paper to use again next year. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Christmas at my family home was chaos. Kids diving under the tree, lots of chocolate and squealing! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Here we go."}, {"time": "15000", "image": "engenn6le18ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Meal tickets? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Once a month, I\u2018ll serve you a meal where I work.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thank you. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: My pleasure. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: A recorder? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Talk into it, then plug it into your laptop. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It will transcribe voice to text. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:This is such a great gift! I\u2018m going to use it every day! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We're so happy you like it."}, {"time": "32000", "image": "engenn6le18ob05re2img06.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: A photo of a website? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Your website. It comes online tomorrow. You're going to blog and vlog about cooking and recipes! The web designer is helping you out for a year. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh Sally! What can I say! It's amazing!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Glad you like it.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: A key? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Look out the window. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: A car! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's nothing. Just a little lottery prize!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Get your coats on ladies! We're going to go for a spin!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le18ob05re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le18ob05re2aud01", "images": []}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 2, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Celebrating Christmas"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Thanks for the Gift"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 18}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We have four ways of talking about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the simple future <span class=\"italic\">will</span>. <br> <span class=\"strong\">Example:</span> <span class=\"italic\">I'll serve a meal where I work.</span> <br><br>  Intentions and plans use <span class=\"italic\">be going to</span>. <br> <span class=\"strong\">Example:</span> <span class=\"italic\">I'm going to use it every day!</span> <br><br>  For things that are arranged, or booked for the future, you use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Continuous</span> tense. <br> <span class=\"strong\">Example:</span> <span class=\"italic\">The web designer is helping you out for a year</span>. <br><br>  To talk about schedules or timetables in the future, you use the <span class=\"italic\">Simple Present</span> tense. <br> <span class=\"strong\">Examples:</span> <span class=\"italic\">Your website. It comes online tomorrow</span>. <br><br>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Thanking People and Responding to Thanks"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can thank people to show appreciation for a gift or an act of kindness  and respond to thanks in great variety of ways. Here  are some examples:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh Sally! What can I say! It's amazing!</br> <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Glad you like it."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Thanking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Thanks\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Thanks.</br> Thank you.</br> Thanks a lot. </br>Thank you so much.</br> It's just what I need!</br> It was very kind of you.</br> I appreciate the\u2026\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You're welcome. (US) </br>Not at all. (formal, UK)</br> Don't mention it. </br>It's my pleasure./ My pleasure.</br> It's nothing.</br> I'm happy you like it.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to unwrap"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take the paper off a gift"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's unwrap our gifts! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le18ob05aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about Christmas."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chaos"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a state of total confusion "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Christmas morning was chaos at our house!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le18ob05aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to fold"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to bend to make smaller"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We had to fold the wrapping paper to save! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le18ob05aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to go for a spin"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to go for a drive"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's go for a spin in my new car! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le18ob05aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to transcribe"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to change spoken words to writing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The recorder transcribes the text when you plug it into your computer. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le18ob05aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to dive "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move down into, like into water"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We would dive into the pile of gifts. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le18ob05aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to squeal"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make a high pitched sound of excitement"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We squealed as we dove into the presents! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le18ob05aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "recorder "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a device used to record voice"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You bought me a recorder! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le18ob05aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "prize"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something valuable that you win"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's just a little lottery prize! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le18ob05aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to vlog"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to video blog "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I vlog on the internet on my website. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le18ob05aud10"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le18ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of 5 gifts that you have been happy to give or receive."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of 5 gifts that you disappointed with. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Tell your partner what the gifts were and why you did or didn't like them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Be as specific as possible."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I make a list of gifts I enjoyed giving or receiving. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make a list of gifts I didn't enjoy receiving."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I explain to a partner why I did or did not like them."}]}]}